msgid "When you would use this"
msgstr "Kada vam ovo treba"

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:17
msgid ""
"An inheritance or a sale covers several parcels and you want to check all of "
"them together."
msgstr ""
"Nasljeđivanje ili prodaja obuhvaća više čestica i želite ih provjeriti sve "
"zajedno."

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:18
msgid ""
"You have a spreadsheet of parcels from a client and want the land registry "
"unit of each."
msgstr ""
"Od klijenta ste dobili tablicu čestica i želite zemljišnoknjižni uložak svake"
" od njih."

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:19
msgid ""
"You want to find out which parcels of a list do not exist or are misnumbered."
msgstr ""
"Želite utvrditi koje čestice s popisa ne postoje ili imaju pogrešan broj."

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:21 commands/batch-lr-unit.md:20
