#: commands/search-municipality.md:75 commands/search.md:97
msgid "If something goes wrong"
msgstr "Ako nešto ne uspije"

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:126
msgid ""
"A parcel that does not exist does not stop the run. It gets a cross in the "
"**Status** column and an explanation in an **ERRORS** table at the end:"
msgstr ""
"Čestica koja ne postoji ne prekida obradu. Dobiva križić u stupcu **Status** "
"i objašnjenje u tablici **GREŠKE** na kraju:"

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:159
msgid "Correct the number and run the command again for that parcel alone."
msgstr "Ispravite broj i ponovno pokrenite naredbu samo za tu česticu."

#: commands/batch-fetch.md:161
msgid ""
"If the tool cannot find the file you named, check that Terminal is in the "
"folder where the file is, or type the full path to it. Other messages are "
"explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako alat ne može pronaći datoteku koju ste naveli, provjerite je li Terminal "
"u mapi u kojoj je datoteka, ili upišite njezinu punu putanju. Ostale poruke "
"objašnjene su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

